        "custom_liquid": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center; \">PRIVACY POLICY</h2>\n\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n  <p>\n    At <strong>House of Sonali</strong>, we value your concerns about online privacy and security while browsing and shopping at our website. \n    We make every effort to guarantee that the information you provide will not be misused. \n    If for some reason the following privacy and security policy does not answer your questions, please contact us. \n    We value your feedback and look forward to improving our services to better meet your needs. \n    This Privacy Policy describes how House of Sonali manages personal information and respects your privacy. \n    This policy may be amended from time to time.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>REGISTRATION</h3>\n  <p>\n    House of Sonali keeps track of your information to offer you the best possible experience. \n    You are required to provide your <strong>phone number and email address</strong> as mandatory Personal Information during registration (sign-up). \n    After registration, House of Sonali will be able to access your account whenever you visit our website. \n    Customers must also provide other details such as <strong>name, phone number, billing and shipping addresses</strong> before completing their first purchase.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>COLLECTION OF PERSONAL INFORMATION</h3>\n  <p>\n    As a visitor, you can explore many parts of the site without providing any Personal Information. \n    Some information we request is mandatory, and some is voluntary. \n    If you do not provide the mandatory information for a specific activity, you may not be able to engage in that activity. \n    When you register and order products as a House of Sonali customer, we may collect your \n    <strong>name, phone numbers, address, email address, password, purchase details, and your interactions with us</strong>.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>UPDATING YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION</h3>\n  <p>\n    You have the right to access, correct, or delete your Personal Information and privacy preferences at any time. \n    This can be done through the <strong>\"My Account\"</strong> section, where you can view and edit most details. \n    For security reasons, certain information can only be changed by contacting support. \n    We will respond to your request within a reasonable time.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>HOW YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION IS USED</h3>\n  <p>\n    House of Sonali collects your information to provide services, comply with legal obligations, and improve our products and offerings. \n    We share information only with trusted affiliates, subsidiaries, and service providers (e.g., IT support, customer service, email delivery, auditing, infrastructure, website management). \n    They are required to use your data solely for providing services to us, consistent with this policy.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>HOUSE OF SONALI MAY USE THIS INFORMATION TO</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Process financial transactions and service your orders</li>\n    <li>Respond to customer service requests and questions</li>\n    <li>Administer your account</li>\n    <li>Send requested product or service information</li>\n    <li>Keep you informed about special offers and services from us or selected third parties</li>\n    <li>Administer promotions and notify you of events</li>\n    <li>Investigate or act on illegal activities and violations of our Terms of Service</li>\n    <li>Improve our site, services, and product offerings</li>\n    <li>Customize your shopping experience</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p>\n    In certain cases, House of Sonali may disclose personal data in response to lawful requests by government authorities. \n    We may also disclose information to comply with warrants, court orders, or legal notices; \n    to protect rights, safety, or property; to investigate fraud; or for matters of national security or law enforcement.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>INFORMATION SHARING WITH SERVICE PROVIDERS</h3>\n  <p>\n    We use trusted payment gateway companies to bill you for goods and services. \n    To our knowledge, these companies do not retain, share, or store personal information for other purposes. \n    We may also share information with companies providing services on our behalf (such as shipping, logistics, and IT management). \n    They are required to protect your data and limit use strictly to fulfilling services for House of Sonali. \n    We do not sell or rent your personal information to other companies for their own marketing.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>DATA RETENTION</h3>\n  <p>\n    We retain your personal information as long as your account is active, your data is needed to provide services, or as required by law. \n    If you wish to delete your account or request that we no longer use your information, \n    please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@houseofsonali.com\">support@houseofsonali.com</a>. \n    We will respond within a reasonable time. \n    We may continue to retain certain data as necessary to comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce agreements.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>UNSUBSCRIBE / OPT OUT</h3>\n  <p>\n    You may opt out of receiving House of Sonali newsletters or promotional emails through your <strong>My Account</strong> settings or during sign-up. \n    However, you will still receive essential service-related emails such as registration confirmations, order updates, and notifications about changes to Terms of Service.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>PROTECTION OF YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION</h3>\n  <p>\n    Your personal information is protected through secure servers, password-restricted access, and encryption. \n    When you enter sensitive information (such as credit card details) on our site, we use <strong>transport layer security (TLS)</strong> to encrypt the data. \n    Although we take all reasonable precautions, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure. \n    If you have any questions regarding this policy, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@houseofsonali.com\">support@houseofsonali.com</a>.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>COOKIE POLICY</h3>\n  <p>\n    Like many websites, we use cookies to improve your shopping experience and save you time. \n    Cookies help us recognize you when you return, remember your preferences, and provide a more personalized experience. \n    Cookies do not store sensitive personal information. \n    Third-party cookies may also be used for advertising and analytics.\n  </p>\n\n  <h4>Categories of Use</h4>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Authentication:</strong> Recognize you when logged in and personalize your experience.</li>\n    <li><strong>Security:</strong> Support our security features and detect malicious activity.</li>\n    <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> Store language and communication preferences.</li>\n    <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> Show relevant ads on and off our site, based on activity.</li>\n    <li><strong>Performance & Analytics:</strong> Understand and improve site performance, features, and research.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY</h3>\n  <p>\n    We may update this Privacy Policy periodically without prior notice. \n    Your continued use of our services constitutes acceptance of the current Privacy Policy and Terms & Conditions. \n    We encourage you to review this page regularly for updates.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>CONTACT</h3>\n  <p>\n    If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or if you need to update, change, or remove information, \n    please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@houseofsonali.com\">support@houseofsonali.com</a>.\n  </p>\n</div>\n<style> #MainContent{ display:none </style>",
